@startuml FIG-CL-TAV-09
skinparam shadowing false
title FIG-CL-TAV-09 v3. SysML 1.6 notation-based views; executable/metamodel conformance is not claimed
' Approved figlib candidate v3 mapped to controlled ids. Not a proof of equivalence.
rectangle EV
' group EV: Evaluator only
rectangle AV
' group AV: Algorithm visible
rectangle XO
' group XO: Excluded, still counted
rectangle E2
' group E2: E2  Run arms / same pool, same action library
component E0
' entity E0: E0  Declare scenario pool / IUT configuration, fault plan, resource mode; / fixed before any run  (IF-EXP-SCENE)
component E1
' entity E1: E1  Inject fault, confirm execution / per scenario  (IF-EXP-INJECT)
component A0
' entity A0: CL-T / test / only
component A1
' entity A1: CL-A / analysis / only
component A2
' entity A2: CL-TA / test + / analysis
component A3
' entity A3: CL-LOOP / closed / loop
component E3
' entity E3: E3  Collect records / I_k, q, cost, resource log  (IF-EXP-COLLECT)
component E4
' entity E4: E4  Validity filter / invalid, equivalent or missing runs leave / the answered subset  (IF-EXP-FILTER)
component E5
' entity E5: E5  Evaluate against truth / DETECT / LOCATE / ABLATION with attempt / and answered-subset denominators  (IF-EXP-EVAL)
component E6
' entity E6: E6  Answer RQ1–RQ3 / comparable projections only; / no unrun numbers
component TR
' entity TR: Truth record / injection plan and / execution confirmation / (IF-EXP-TRUTH)
component X0
' entity X0: invalid run / instrument or setup fault
component X1
' entity X1: equivalent fault / observationally / indistinguishable
component X2
' entity X2: missing record / collection gap
component X3
' entity X3: unanswered / attempt counted, / not answered
E0 --> E1 : m0
E1 --> E2 : m1
E2 --> E3 : m2
E3 --> E4 : m3
E4 --> E5 : m4
E5 --> E6 : m5
E1 --> TR : t1 confirmation
TR --> E4 : t2 evaluator-only check
TR --> E5 : t3 ground truth
TR ..> E2 : truth-arms never an / algorithm input
E3 --> E1 : lp next scenario / × arm
E4 --> XO : ex excluded
note as TN
  Truth is never an
  algorithm input.
end note
note as NT
  Shared pool: no arm sees CL-LOOP records; excluded runs stay in the attempt denominator.
end note
note as legend
  Legend: experiment flow; repeat; forbidden leakage; exclusion; method under test
end note
note as truth-boundary
  Registered interfaces remain constraints on this view. Algorithm calls: IF-PRED-OBS, IF-SELECT-ADMIT, IF-EXECUTE-RECORD, IF-OBS-INTERPRET, IF-PREP-RECOVER, IF-HIST-UPDATE, IF-EQUIV, IF-RESOURCE-STOP. Experiment I/O: IF-EXP-SCENE, IF-EXP-INJECT, IF-EXP-TRUTH, IF-EXP-COLLECT, IF-EXP-RUN, IF-EXP-FILTER, IF-EXP-EVAL. Campaigns: EXP-CLTAV-DETECT, EXP-CLTAV-LOCATE, EXP-CLTAV-ABLATION. Arms: CL-T / CL-A / CL-TA / CL-LOOP. Truth is evaluator-only and is never an algorithm input. The truth-to-run edge is forbidden leakage. This note records the interface boundary; it is not a measured result.
end note
@enduml
